WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
Yuqin, we are good best friends.

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:06,400
When the time comes to eat, please help me hate Zhang Yi a little more.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,910
Go away, who is your best friend?

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:13,190
This time I went out and spent a lot of effort to find these supplies.

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:15,590
The original intention is to share it with everyone

6
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:19,980
However, this is a critical moment, and I will never raise a virtuous person.

7
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:23,410
If you eat these things, you have to take up arms to fight against the enemy

8
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,370
Anyone who dares to eat will not work

9
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,650
I promise to make him spit out as much as he eats.

10
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:31,250
Okay, let's divide the food.

11
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:36,860
Come one by one

12
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:40,470
Don't say I'm overbearing, I'm a very fair person

13
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:43,350
If anyone here thinks that I am overbearing

14
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,430
You can put down the food in your hands now
